        <h1>
            <a href="#Using+ROW_NUMBER()+to+paginate+your+data+with+SQL+Server+2005+and+asp.net+c#"><span style="color: #000000">Using ROW_NUMBER() to paginate your data
                with SQL Server 2005 and asp.net c#</span></a></h1>
         <br />
         <div id = "xml">
         SELECT TOP 20 * FROM<br />
        (<br />
            SELECT zip,city,state,latitude,longitude,timezone,dst,<br />
	               ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY zip) AS num<br />
	               FROM dbo.zipcode<br />
        ) AS a<br />
        WHERE num > 0<br />
         </div>
        <br />We found about <strong>43191 records</strong>, now viewing <strong>1</strong> through <strong>20</strong>.<br />
        << prev | <a href = "?start=20">next >></a>
